      "writtenOn": "2024-04-10T12:25:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is present in the \"vm_entry\" node, which will be 3rd from the end if we account for vendor partition node as well.\n\nWe could have changed this to\n```\n        ConstraintSpec::new(\n            ConstraintType::ExactMatch,\n            vec![CONFIG_DESC, INSTANCE_ID],\n            MissingAction::Fail,\n            CertIndex::FromEnd(2),\n        ),\n```\n\n`CertIndex::FromEnd` api was an optimization to ensure dice_policy_builder library does not need to lookup each entry, which is fine to use if we definitely know the entry location (for example payload will always be the last) but I\u0027m less inclined on using this for other nodes since DICE chains by design are extensible \u0026 we have seen atleast one recent project that changed to position of vm_enry DiceChainEntry from 2nd to 3rd from the end.",
